{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119877","id":3770001907,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7gtanz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119877","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119877.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119877.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119877","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119877/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119877/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119877/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/986dea4d2ddabff21f60357bfcea32065e17a11b","number":119877,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Reduce cognitive complexity in build generation utilities","user":{"login":"matteopaloschi","id":42005410,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDA1NDEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42005410?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi","html_url":"https://github.com/matteopaloschi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteopaloschi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n* Unification of authors/donors header generation logic.\r\n* Minor simplifications in the license parsing flow.\r\n* Reduced nesting in conditional branches.\r\n* Small readability improvements across helper functions.\r\n* Consistent handling of unused `env` parameters.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nRefactors several build-time source generation utilities to reduce duplicated logic and simplify control flow.\r\n\r\nMain changes include:\r\n\r\n* Unification of authors/donors header generation logic.\r\n* Minor simplifications in the license parsing flow.\r\n* Reduced nesting in conditional branches.\r\n* Small readability improvements across helper functions.\r\n* Consistent handling of unused `env` parameters.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\nThe goal of this refactor is to improve maintainability and readability of the build generation utilities without changing behavior.\r\n\r\nThis also reduces duplicated logic between header generators and makes future modifications easier.\r\n\r\n## Technical overview\r\n\r\n### Header generation helpers\r\n\r\n`make_authors_header()` and `make_donors_header()` previously duplicated almost identical parsing and generation logic.\r\n\r\nThe shared behavior was extracted into:\r\n\r\n* `make_authors_or_donors_header()`\r\n\r\nThis keeps section-specific configuration localized while centralizing the parsing/writing flow.\r\n\r\n### License parsing flow\r\n\r\nThe license parser received small structural cleanups:\r\n\r\n* flattened some conditional branches,\r\n* simplified iteration flow,\r\n* reduced repeated operations,\r\n* improved readability of list construction logic.\r\n\r\nNo behavioral changes were intended.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nTested by:\r\n\r\n* running the build generation step successfully,\r\n* running SonarScanner locally to verify complexity changes.\r\n\r\nNo functional regressions were observed.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nThis PR is intended as a pure refactor and should not affect generated output.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=